<title>GERMANY: GERMAN DATA NEXT WEEK - Retail, insolvencies.</title>
<headline>GERMAN DATA NEXT WEEK - Retail, insolvencies.</headline>
<dateline>BONN 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following German economic indicators are expected to be released next week:</p>
<p>    INDICATOR	PERIOD	 PREVIOUS		 EXPECTED</p>
<p>					    DATA		     DATE</p>
<p> Retail sales	June    May -3.0 y/y -1.0 m/m     Oct 22</p>
<p> Retail sales	H1	  Q1 -1.0 pct y/y	   Oct 22</p>
<p> Insolvencies	July     June +12 pct y/y	   Oct 22-23</p>
<p> Import prices     Sept     Aug -0.3 pct y/y	   Oct 23-24</p>
<p> Foreign trade     H1 rev   H1 +45.5 bln marks	 Oct 25-28</p>
<p>NOTE - The Federal Statistics Office said the expected release dates were targets.</p>
<p>-- Bonn newsroom, 49-228-26097150</p>
</text>
